# LAHI AI service

Copy to `ai/.env`. Never commit real secrets or model credentials.

```bash
AI_SERVER_TOKEN=dev-ai-token
AI_EXECUTION_MODE=mock
AI_QUEUE_BACKEND=inline
AI_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000
AI_STORAGE_ROOT=
```

`AI_EXECUTION_MODE=mock` runs the full try-on job lifecycle without GPU weights.
`AI_EXECUTION_MODE=gpu` selects real Florence / SAM2 / pose / IDM adapters when those weights exist.

Google Colab is only one possible GPU worker. Point the commerce app at whatever host serves `/v1`.
